@section api_register_index Register definitions

Register and bit definitions are grouped separately from driver functions.
For example:

* <a href="../ch32v0/html/group__gpio__defines.html">CH32V00x GPIO defines</a>
  and <a href="../ch32v0/html/group__rcc__defines.html">RCC defines</a>;
* <a href="../ch5xx58x/html/group__gpio__defines.html">CH58x GPIO defines</a>,
  <a href="../ch5xx58x/html/group__clk__defines.html">clock defines</a>, and
  <a href="../ch5xx58x/html/group__rwa__defines.html">RWA defines</a>.

Use the family module tree for the complete list.
